[projlang/projlang/structural] Evaluate structural stages (started) @dispatch(mechanical)
Files: crates/grimoire/src/evaluate.rs and crates/grimoire/tests/evaluate.rs.
Evaluate declared input reprojections, select references/generated definitions, structural folding by address, and invert over selected groups. Preserve definition origin so shared references join while competing definitions fail. Keep decorations unavailable until structural evaluation completes.
Accept: Fixtures prove generated and referenced definitions, chained folding, competing-definition failure, inversion of selected connections, and structural equality despite different decorations.
